        "approval_date": "2013-02-27",
        "description": {
          "text": "Updated Clinical Studies and Microbiology-Resistance labeling with trial P06086 anemia management results (erythropoietin vs ribavirin dose reduction); no new indication added",
          "citations": [
            {
              "quote": "This \u201cPrior Approval\u201d supplemental new drug application provides for updates to the Clinical Studies Section 14, of the Package Insert (PI), with the results of clinical trial P06086, entitled, \u201cBoceprevir and Peginterferon/Ribavirin for the Treatment of Chronic Hepatitis C in Treatment-Naive Subjects: A Comparison of Erythropoietin Use Versus Ribavirin Dose Reduction for the Management of Anemia.\u201d In addition, the Microbiology-Resistance Section of the PI was updated with new information about the impact of specific amino acid substitutions on HCV replicon susceptibility to boceprevir.",
              "doc_id": "44b9d768-d403-5cb0-b71c-d77db41b5aa3",
              "line": 7
            }
          ]
        },
